# Camera App (OpenCV)

## Overview
This project captures video from a webcam using OpenCV, displays the live feed, and logs frame information such as resolution, timestamp, and FPS.

## Features
- Webcam video capture
- Real-time display using OpenCV
- Frame logging (resolution, FPS, timestamp)
- Modular C++ class design (`Camera` class)

## Project Structure

project/
├── include/
│   └── Camera.h
├── src/
│   ├── main.cpp
│   └── Camera.cpp
├── out/
│   └── camera_app
├── Makefile
└── README.md

## Build Instructions 
From the root folder called make 

## Execute the Program 
Connect USB camera device 
Ensure that the machine that you are running it on can see the connected camera
build the program using -> make  
run the program using -> ./out/camera_app

